WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:05.870
<i>It's been an exciting day here on the 
last day of the Nafrece Women's Open.</i>

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>The strong wind is hurting
many players' scores,</i>

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.550
<i>but veteran player Chris Christina, 
who began in 38th place,</i>

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.790
<i>has been making a dash for the lead 
since the back nine began.</i>

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.600
<i>She's raised her score with 6 birdies in a row, 
and is currently in 4th place.</i>

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.500
<i>It's hard to believe she didn't make it 
past qualifiers in her last 5 matches.</i>

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.410
<i>Another #7?</i>

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.960
<i>A totally different choice 
than she made yesterday...</i>

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.480
<i>18th hole, par 4. 
This is Chris's second shot.</i>

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.080
<i>She got it within a meter of the pin.</i>

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.600
<i>She has a chance for a birdie. 
Even if her rank doesn't rise after this,</i>

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.500
<i>she'll be within the top 50 
for the prize rankings,</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.090
<i>and almost certainly keep her seed 
for the 10th year in a row.</i>

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.850
Chris Christina.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:16.000
She had a leg injury that threatened 
to cost her her seed.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.920
And now she's almost 
a totally different person.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.840
What are you pouting about?

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:27.240
I don't like seeing her play like this.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:31.240
She's slacking off!

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:38.820
Make a big dash in the last half to make sure 
people remember you and think you're good.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:42.830
But don't win. Stop at 4th place.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.620
You make too many requests, old lady.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:50.200
Oh? I think I've paid you 
enough to justify my requests.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.800
Does your seed matter that much to you?

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.200
Of course.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.300
You're not a tour pro, though, so I don't 
expect you to understand.

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.870
You're right. I don't.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.270
Eve!

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.120
The money went through.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.820
Let's get something good to eat on the way home.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.280
Can we get dessert? Can we?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.980
Just for today.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:54.530
We're closed.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.020
I'm back!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.990
Job's over!

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.240
And we brought presents!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.600
Presents? What did you bring?

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:03.410
Sweets?

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.840
Toys?

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.650
Get this: Both!

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.630
Yay! Yay!

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:13.910
Calm down! There's enough for everybody!

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:16.620
Hey, don't touch me there—

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.610
You tired, Eve?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:19.050
Not at all. It was an easy job.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.090
Hurry! Hurry!

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.200
Yes? What is it?

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.060
At this hour?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.680
Wait, you can't—

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.640
Where do I need to be?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.330
Okay, got it.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.150
Bye.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.480
Eve, you...

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.990
I need money.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:45.990
I can't let them end up on the street.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:52.050
Don't worry. I'm invincible.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.540
<i>Rainbow</i>

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.540
<i>Bullet</i>

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.380
What the heck?

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.220
They called us out here and they're late?

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.400
I'm sleepy...

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:13.110
We got here a long time ago.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:20.660
Hey, it's old man Kevin!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.410
I thought you went broke 
after that last bet.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.300
I got an unexpected bonus.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.840
You never learn.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.000
Why not open a savings account?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.650
I always get even!

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:36.040
You're still playing with only three clubs?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.540
You think it'll be easy, don't you?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.650
What are the rules?

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.960
One hole match. 6000 eurus.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.510
6000?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.370
That's ten times the usual amount!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:50.570
What? You scared, Eve?

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:54.200
And they call you the "Rainbow Bullet"!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.720
It's obvious you're trying to provoke me.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.610
You in, or not?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.600
I'm in. Of course.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.840
So, you're my opponent?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.310
That's right.

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:08.040
I had her come just to beat you.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.800
I'm CC. Nice to meet you.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.030
Good stuff.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.400
It's been a while 
since I've felt this excited.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.460
Knew it.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.430
The exact middle of the fairway!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.920
And that was a 230 yard drive! Nice!

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.480
Your turn.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.590
Lily, you take the tee shot.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:45.740
Okay!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:52.820
Ultra Super Hyper...

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:56.790
Miracle Shot!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.680
Oh! Nice!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.580
That was over 70 yards.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.740
Your best shot yet, I think.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.430
I've been practicing, you know!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.510
Such a promising youngster!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.480
I can't hide my greatness.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.640
What's with you people?

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.880
You don't seem very concerned.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.230
Don't worry.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:21.010
I'm on edge, actually.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:24.020
I told you. You excite me.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.100
<i>Eve</i>

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:32.820
<i>She's using her driver 
for the second shot, too?</i>

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:36.080
<i>She can't reach the green from here.</i>

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:40.470
<i>She thinks she's special 'cause 
they all tell her she's "invincible".</i>

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:46.470
<i>Today I'm getting back all that money 
she took from me, with interest!</i>

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.000
<i>You ready, Rainbow Bullet Eve?</i>

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:54.450
Eve's not underestimating you, okay?

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.560
She can be a pain in the butt.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.930
Unless things are really tense, 
she can't enjoy herself.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:05.280
Get ready, 'cause the Rainbow Bullet's 
about to blow your head off.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.810
The "Rainbow Bullet".

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.600
What a cool name.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:21.240
<i>Pierce your opponent's heart 
clean through with a single shot.</i>

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:29.380
<i>Destroy them mentally.</i>

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.550
<i>Make it so they'll never 
want to face you again.</i>

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.520
<i>Load the bullet.</i>

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.890
<i>Cock the hammer.</i>

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.570
<i>Aim.</i>

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.400
<i>Pull the trigger.</i>

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.030
<i>And fire it from the barrel!</i>

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.910
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:58.040
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.240
Fool! What are you aiming at?

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:24.390
Bingo!

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:39.470
The shot. The speed. The trajectory.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:42.500
They're all nothing like 
what I saw this afternoon...

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:47.470
You wanted to know if you were stronger 
than me at your full strength, didn't you?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:53.370
I had Lily make the tee shot to give
 you a handicap for your injured leg.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.340
Now we're even.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.760
It's your turn...

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.330
Old lady.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:05.020
Don't break on me that easily.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.100
The match isn't over.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:11.560
No, it's over.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:16.200
A 12 hour flight...

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.710
Nafrece is a long way away.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:21.280
Aoi, you must be tired, right?

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.590
Let's take a taxi to the hotel...

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:26.660
I'd rather see the course first.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:30.540
I thought you'd say that, 
so I reserved us a tee time.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.780
That's my Amane! I love you!

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:35.840
That love will never be.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.480
Wow, we're rich!

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:43.420
Just one hole and we got 6000 eurus!

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:46.560
And the old lady gave up and quit halfway,

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.740
and then the look on old man Kevin's face...

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.360
It was hilarious! 
I'm not even sleepy anymore!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.310
I expected a little 
more out of a pro tourer.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.700
What, you didn't get your rocks off?

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.730
Yeah. I'm still not satisfied.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.710
Want to use this money to go have some fun?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:07.670
That might be nice.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:08.750
Right?

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:23.980
Sister!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.890
Leave!

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.310
Eve?!

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.800
Take this and go!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.400
We can't help it.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:43.030
We don't have the right to live here.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.750
Or do business here.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:47.980
If we don't have them turn a blind eye,

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.400
they'll tear us apart.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:58.000
If it were just the 
three of us, we'd be fine.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:58.880
But...

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.860
The kids...

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:34.720
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.910
<i>I know I need to be on top of things here...</i>

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:40.910
<i>But I keep making you do everything...</i>

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:56.120
Oh? In a bad mood?

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.080
Lily?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.760
Mr. Robert, the local boss, 
says he wants a match.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.270
If you win, 2000!

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:04.330
And if I lose?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.460
It's a secret!

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.800
You've been up all night. You okay?

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:11.800
I won't be able to sleep like this.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.310
Shinjuku, Tokyo

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.560
Amawashi HQ Building

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:21.560
Amane, how's Aoi doing?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.040
<i>Physically, just fine.</i>

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.820
<i>No jet lag, even.</i>

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.790
Can she win?

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:30.910
<i>I've got all the data on her opponents.</i>

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:33.790
If she plays like she usually does,

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.910
she has no chance of losing.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.420
<i>I expect good news.</i>

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.420
U15 Women's Championship

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.420
You could get the news faster online.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.620
Goodbye, then.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.700
Wow, this course is so pretty!

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.510
It's nothing like the ones we usually use.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.800
How much do you think it costs 
to play a round here?

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.270
Want to ask?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.060
Nah, I'll pass.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.340
Sorry, did I keep you waiting?

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.690
Mr. Robert!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.530
Sorry for the sudden request.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.670
No, I couldn't turn down 
a request from you, Lily.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:13.540
But I'm too old to challenge 
the Rainbow Bullet myself.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.490
I had my niece come instead.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.240
Your niece?

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:21.780
She just turned 15...

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.250
Oh, there she is.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.390
Aoi, time's up.

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:26.840
Let's leave the course.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.960
Amane, was that call from my mother?

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.850
She's worried.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.750
It's her only daughter's world debut.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.200
Anybody good entering?

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:40.430
Hmm. I guess this nation's junior champion.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.050
Helene...

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.790
Helene Robert.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.290
Welcome, Helene.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:48.700
Good afternoon, uncle.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:52.710
Um, I thought we were playing you.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:55.590
I really wanted to win, you see,

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.180
so I'm having my niece play.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.200
It's a three hole match!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:04.120
Don't forget what happens if you lose, Lily.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:06.880
Okay...

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:09.210
Let's just start.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:12.590
You're only playing with three clubs?

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.250
It's a fine handicap.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.180
You're quite confident.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:18.180
Sorry.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.870
I'll apologize before we start.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.840
I'm in a terrible mood today.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:29.190
<i>She doesn't look like a golfer at all.</i>

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.190
<i>And she only has three clubs.</i>

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.190
<i>She looks even worse than an amateur.</i>

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.810
<i>But her stance isn't bad.</i>

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:38.790
<i>Now, how will she handle this course?</i>

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.760
<i>That big tree blocks 
the middle of the fairway.</i>

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.680
<i>There's a lake to the right.</i>

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:46.960
<i>And a bunker to the left.</i>

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.800
<i>I'd do a fade from the left 
to aim for the fairway.</i>

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.680
<i>But does she have that kind of skill?</i>

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:57.460
Direct strike...

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.040
Blue Bullet!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.780
<i>She shot straight through?</i>

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:09.900
<i>Is she just stupid?</i>

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.820
<i>It'll hit that tree.</i>

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:15.680
Pierce through!

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.170
I-It snapped the branch!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.560
<i>She did that deliberately?</i>

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.910
<i>But what if it bounced off the branch?</i>

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:36.640
<i>What a reckless approach... 
relying on brute strength!</i>

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:39.430
<i>Eve</i>

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:44.480
<i>Her form's a mess because she's 
forcing herself to use the #7...</i>

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:48.090
<i>But her shot's perfect!</i>

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:52.400
<i>Perfectly straight...</i>

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.400
<i>Eve</i>

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.400
<i>Forceful.</i>

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:01.490
Who are you?

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:07.290
I've never seen you at any school, 
or any tournament in this country!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:10.710
Are you a pro?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.460
I'm no pro.

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:15.800
Not even a golfer.

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:20.710
All I do is hit a ball 
with a stick to make money.

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.200
<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.950
<i>The only way I know how to live.</i>

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.440
<i>Is to keep pulling the trigger...</i>

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.520
<i>Direct strike!</i>

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:40.960
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.810
Your turn.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.320
What's wrong?

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.200
I forfeit.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:00.230
I said I forfeit.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.450
Seeing the way you play,

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.900
playing against you will 
throw me off my game.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:07.180
I have a championship in two days.

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:09.140
Helene...

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:11.520
I'm sorry, uncle.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.400
But I can't play around anymore.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.600
I have a championship...

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.150
You're running?

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:20.020
You're giving up and running?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.830
I-I told you!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.910
I have something more 
important than playing you!

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:32.240
Pleasure doing business.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.760
Fine!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:35.560
<i>No...</i>

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:38.170
<i>I can't get the image out of my head.</i>

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:44.770
<i>The shots, the trajectories 
I've envisioned since I was little...</i>

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.950
<i>If I'd kept playing against her,</i>

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.880
<i>my ideals would have crushed me...</i>

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.820
<i>God is unfair...</i>

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.530
<i>I've practiced so hard since I was 4...</i>

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.560
<i>And the ideals I've had 
for all those years...</i>

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.600
<i>How come that girl...</i>

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.530
Good work.

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:09.010
I'm glad we kept your chastity safe, Lily.

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:10.480
Huh? What do you mean?

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.220
I thought if we lost the match,

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:16.430
you'd lose the most 
important thing a girl has.

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:17.550
No way.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.730
You read too many comics.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.880
Then, what did you bet?

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.050
A Gunpla!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.250
What?

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:27.970
A Gundam plastic model!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.260
AKA Gunpla!

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:31.530
It's a special limited-run 
anniversary model!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:35.720
It's super-rare! I had to 
save up forever to get it!

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:37.930
Sorry. I don't get it.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.240
It's fine.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.280
Everyone has their own hobbies.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.930
Now what do we do?

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.960
We already hit off the tee.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.300
Why not finish the game?

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.610
It's a pretty course, and it 
might be fun to practice on it.

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:51.280
Yeah.

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:55.620
Would you like to play with me?

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.150
Who are you?

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:59.700
Aoi Amawashi.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.190
Chinese? Japanese?

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:03.280
Japanese.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.670
Japan!

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.410
The land of anime!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.720
I'm so jealous! You can 
buy all the Gunpla you want!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.390
Gun... what?

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.480
Gunpla! Gunpla!

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:16.400
I'm sorry. I don't know what that is.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:17.880
It's okay.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.120
Everyone has their own hobbies.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.600
Sure.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:23.890
But how much will you bet?

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:27.580
I'd say a minimum of a hundred...

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.580
- I won't bet.

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:33.240
Golf is a sacred sport, 
and that would be an insult to it.

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:34.960
I see.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.580
Okay.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.090
Instead...

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.520
I'll use this to get your interest.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:49.140
<i>T-That driver's shaft is 48 inches...</i>

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.680
<i>A 48-inch driver?</i>

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.940
<i>And she's no bigger than I am!</i>

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:56.270
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.690
<i>She smiling?</i>

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.860
<i>Pakkun, fly for me.</i>

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.320
<i>Into the great big sky!</i>

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:16.820
<i>That shot...</i>

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:26.170
<i>Surpassed the Blue Bullet?</i>

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:29.440
<i>How can she shoot so far 
when she's so little?</i>

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:31.280
<i>Who is this girl?</i>

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:35.120
She's so competitive...

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.010
This is bad.

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:41.010
Her finger's on the trigger.

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:42.210
Well?

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:43.980
Want to play a round with me?

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:46.440
I don't play golf for fun.

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:48.550
How rude.

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.070
I'm always serious when I play golf.

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:54.460
If you want to play, it has to be a match.

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:57.170
A battle, with survival on the line!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.840
Fine by me.

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.720
No hesitation... I like that.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:05.120
I'll pierce you through...

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:06.830
with my...

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:08.800
Rainbow Bullet!

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:50.020
Next Episode

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.180
Huh? What happens with my match against Aoi?

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:46.510
The Rainbow Bullet wins, of course.

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:50.040
If you want to see me win, 
make your approach shot and get nice and close!
